OL,3,GNEWSABaker shows off gingerbread
OL,4,Alandmark ahead of UK-first festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baker who created an edible replica
OL,7,Fof a Lancashire landmark will judge the
OL,8,FUK's first gingerbread house
OL,9,Fcompetition this weekend.
OL,11,FDebby Donnelly-Addison, known as The
OL,12,FBoho Baker on social media, won a gold
OL,13,Faward at Cake International 2026 for
OL,14,Fher gingerbread homage to Lancaster's
OL,15,FAshton Memorial.
OL,17,FDonnelly-Addison unveiled her intricate
OL,18,Faward-winning gingerbread creation on
OL,19,FBBC Breakfast on Tuesday ahead of the
OL,20,FGingerbread House Festival in the Lake
OL,21,FDistrict.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
